// Calculate a slice of (a0|c0)^m for all 'a' and fixed 'c', from multiple slices
// of input (a0|(c-i_y)0)^(m+j) with c-components reduced in y-direction
// Inputs:
// - pcimj: [nCartX(lab)]-array with components for (a0|(c-i_y)0)^(m+j)
//   note: down to input components (a0| with |a| = (la-1)...lab are used for input c1m1
//   (i.e., to make output (a0| with |a| = la...lab, we need 'a' components from the input
//   slice (a0|(c-1_y)0)^{m+1} of minimum angular momentum 'a' reduced by 1 to (la-1);
